{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Starsand Island community and stay up to date on the latest development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: Search for &quot;Starsand Island&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the city grind? Return to the warm embrace of Starsand Island, a radiant jewel adrift in the ocean's expanse. Enjoy a relaxed, pastoral life: hang out with adorable capybaras, cats, and dogs, celebrate bountiful catches, explore the mysterious Moonlit Forest, or simply soak up the island's natural beauty. Leave the urban rush behind and rediscover life's simple pleasures in this seaside paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/d7ba449be8a0619f24bc2dc4b7f27d4f.avif?t=1772629219\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/ada755224f9a52debe27076046bf8e87.avif?t=1772629219\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live in Harmony with Nature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow tropical fruits and vegetables on your own farm, make lasting friends with adorable animals, and create a countryside villa on the island's terrain. Decorate cascading terrace gardens and shape the landscape. Every corner of the island is yours to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/3351b7e23f2793b29833e0397cb4ed40.poster.avif?t=1772629219\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/3351b7e23f2793b29833e0397cb4ed40.webm?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.poster.avif?t=1772629219\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.webm?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.mp4?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.poster.avif?t=1772629219\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.webm?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.mp4?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/9768b1611d354a7db6ca59f1c66b70c5.avif?t=1772629219\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Roam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide along pristine coastlines on a longboard, zip through lush forests on a retro scooter, or sail to uncover the secrets of nearby islands. With a variety of vehicles, enjoy the thrill of speed or cruise the iconic coastal highway and take in the island's breathtaking scenery at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.poster.avif?t=1772629219\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.webm?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.mp4?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/cd4346665d8e0b4eb1b778ca76bf2db7.avif?t=1772629219\" width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartwarming Bonds with Islanders</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this close-knit island, every resident has a story to tell. Build lasting friendships through daily interactions and special quests. As your connections grow, you might even find that special someone to share your island life with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.poster.avif?t=1772629219\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.webm?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.mp4?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/1345f16f4b9f6a3b632001c2b525e871.avif?t=1772629219\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/1345f16f4b9f6a3b632001c2b525e871.avif?t=1772629219 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Island\u2019s Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the foggy depths of the island where rich mineral veins, rare treasures, and mysterious ancient ruins await. Learn and use combat skills to battle strange creatures, each encounter full of surprises you won't see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.poster.avif?t=1772629219\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.webm?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.mp4?t=1772629219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Island Newcomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966320/895faf704e0e00ac6eb1a93bfc946a06030dffd9.jpg"},{"name":"Home Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966320/019ad54035eb2604b67c911102d3083c5179ad60.jpg"},{"name":"A Landowner's Pride","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966320/f8365a00e1ca61667a6ef9405f562b63c54a0a96.jpg"},{"name":"Dream Manor","path":"ht